 "text": "Hi! How are you today? Roughly break down some dry twigs into kindling the size of a cigarette, and a small pile of lighter wood nearby. Then light the kindling. They' the classic reason they glow. Pack a couple of them, and some paper or a marshmallow stick for when the fire's going. Roughly the width of your arm, and keep it to the wall of the pot or kettle. Perfect. Just add some water and let it simmer. Enjoy it over your dinner. Let it cool down a bit, then stir in some baking soda or powder and a little water. Stir until it' smooth again.",
